{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21168","headline":"赋得鱼登龙门 · 元稹","name":"赋得鱼登龙门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鱼贯终何益，龙门在苦登。\n有成当作雨，无用耻爲鹏。\n激浪诚难泝，雄心亦自凭。\n风云潜会合，鬐鬣忽腾凌。\n泥滓辞河浊，烟霄见海澄。\n回瞻顺流辈，谁敢望同升。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}